00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:24.120
Sing, add your voice! Dance, join your arms!

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:24.120
Utae koe awase odore kata o kumi

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:29.960
Because you love the Earth so much.

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:29.960
Konnani chikyuu ga suki dakara

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:38.470
Because the dawn is so beautiful!

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:38.470
